<INSTRUCTIONTEXT><![CDATA[ You are about to start the "EI Mock Assessment" examination. This page helps you to understand the overall structure of the Question Paper.<br> <br> <strong>Group wise Instructions :</strong><br> <br> There are 8 Groups in this examination as follows :-<br> <br> 1) General Knowledge<br> 2) Psychometric Question<br> 3) Psychometric Test<br> 4) Typing Test<br> 5) Typing Test Unrestricted<br> 6) Typing Test Stenography<br> 7) Social Awareness<br> 8) Subjective<br> <br> Group 1 - General Knowledge :<br> This group contains four sections - Section 1, Section 2, Section 3, Section 4. All the questions in four sections are mandatory for you to attempt and you cannot submit this group within 1 minute.<br> <br> Group 2 - Psychometric Question :<br> In this group, you will be able to see an image. Please go through the same carefully which will help you to and answer the questions asked in the next group, "Psychometric Test". The maximum time allotted to view the image is 1 minute.<br> <br> Group 3 - Psychometric Test :<br> Answer all the based on the image that you studied in the group "Psychometric Question".<br> <br> Group 4 - Typing Test :<br> Go through the given passage carefully and type the same. The cursor will not move further unless the correct characters are typed. The maximum time allotted is 1 minute. You can take a break of 1 minute upon the completion of this test.<br> <br> Group 5 - Typing Test Unrestricted :<br> Go through the given passage carefully and type the same. Please note that the Backspace and delete key count will be traced.<br> <br> Group 6 - Typing Test Stenography :<br> Listen to the audio played in the background carefully and type the same. You are not allowed to press the backspace and delete key<br> <br> Group 7 - Social Awareness :<br> This group contains 3 sections. Section A is mandatory. You have to select any one out of two sections from 'Optional Sec 1' or 'Optional Sec 2'<br> <br> Group 8 - Subjective :<br> Go through the question and provide your answers in the answer sheet provided.<br> <br> <strong>General Instructions :</strong><br> 1) Some of the questions contain Audio / Video contents. Please ensure that your system supports to hear the audio and play the video clearly.<br> 2) For the questions that require upload of files, please ensure that the file size doesnt exceed the specified limit.<br> 3) Group 1, Group 3, Group 7 : You can view these groups even after submitting the Group. Rest of the groups cannot be viewed upon the submission.<br> 4) Group 1 : You can edit the responses in this group as well after submitting the Group. Rest of the groups are not editable upon the submission.<br> 5) For the questions that require Audio / Video response, please ensure that you have the microphone/webcam connected to the system and the browser is allowed to access the microphone/webcam.<br> <strong>Note :</strong><br> You can view these instructions any time during the assessment by clicking the link 'Instructions' at the top right of the candidate console. ]]></INSTRUCTIONTEXT>
